# Project Name: Project Documentation Phase

## Project Title
Implement Client Script & UI Policy - Incident

## Project Overview
This project implements Client Script and UI Policy
in the ServiceNow Incident Management system.

## Objective
The main objective is to improve the Incident form by
making required fields mandatory and controlling
form behaviour dynamically.

## Technologies Used
- ServiceNow
- JavaScript
- Client Script
- UI Policy
- Incident Table

## Client Script
The Client Script is used to control the Incident form
dynamically based on user actions.

## UI Policy
The UI Policy is used to make fields mandatory,
visible, or read-only based on specified conditions.

## Functionality
- Short Description is made mandatory.
- When Priority is Critical, Assignment Group becomes mandatory.
- When Priority is Critical, Assigned To becomes mandatory.
- When Priority changes to another value, these fields become optional.

## Testing
The Client Script and UI Policy were tested on the
ServiceNow Incident form.

## Expected Result
The Incident form should correctly apply mandatory
conditions based on the selected Priority.

## Conclusion
The project successfully demonstrates the use of
Client Script and UI Policy for Incident Management
in ServiceNow.
